{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":249298,\"title\":\"Swaraj - Bharat ke Swatantrata Sangram Ki Samagra Gatha\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Swaraj is a docu-drama series that celebrates 75 years of Indian independence. It features the lives and sacrifices of lesser-known heroes of the freedom struggle. The show bring to life the stories of unsung heroes who sacrificed and fought for India over 450 years of freedom struggle but remain unheard and unknown to this day despite their untold sacrifices.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5e3pFG4CzL3aypx5w6Lvk18Pile.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9Ihno8gARdojtb4E8UBz0bS27dS.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":2022,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":8,\"totalEpisodes\":75,\"createdBy\":[\"Abhimanyu Singh\"],\"networks\":[\"Prime Video\",\"Doordarshan\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"IN\",\"name\":\"India\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2024-01-13\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":86018,\"name\":\"Manoj Joshi\",\"character\":\"Narrator/Sutradhar\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/u7GllU8dO2bkAvRC0i8yszogYqY.jpg\"},{\"id\":5964307,\"name\":\"Ankur Bhardwaj\",\"character\":\"Brahmachari\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":3827890,\"name\":\"Shivam Gour\",\"character\":\"Udham Singh\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1831442,\"name\":\"Jason Shah\",\"character\":\"Vasco da Gama\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q7dLFiFbwM4QoKg3DcO4OgiSXSh.jpg\"},{\"id\":37235,\"name\":\"Hrishitaa Bhatt\",\"character\":\"Rani Lakshmibai\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4kV1o6U7OENwOSv9h4ujDijAGTw.jpg\"},{\"id\":1244956,\"name\":\"Barkha Bisht\",\"character\":\"Rani Abbakka\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lYIqYhxqqRvOBUsXtaDTGY04RQd.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"7iv1EWZzFqU\",\"name\":\"Promo of \\\"Swaraj: Bharat ke Swatantrata Sangram ki Samagra Gatha\\\"\",